://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_643955654606405_480568527955268312_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eLpeA4FXlbwQ7kNvwGLUUHg&_nc_oc=Ado28A994OAk516Ov6VXQhNrtQmSVfJDTTgueqzZO2ZfI5yxv5p6EL77F6odicmUlPo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_nHd_v0-6c5UoS5mJmd-M8bO5xsnVllYmpgQ-BGFIzMg&oe=6A3AA166"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_34_53.Still005.png", "id": "868776144968854", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57574721_868776148302187_2395318248093284663_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OXQlVHXg3pMQ7kNvwGbuApS&_nc_oc=AdoZMd6EW7xfRh6OLXw-LbACAAIcTKzQe_B2HzhcXRJsxUuELkUBP9o2cwSOem1j6CI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_siniQW1_X7eXmwtS_1Lb3VllswXoF7kgi4Rhb4-3ooA&oe=6A3A96B2"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_25_53.Still002.png", "id": "692760662818107", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982461_692760666151440_1673600769700015261_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kGJ7BDYZp0sQ7kNvwEsIs-E&_nc_oc=AdoOfzB5D9M3d4Iq0rHxK3IWa2RJi0OFWWcuayx1giLAXyLDy0WjxLG9PQdV0-LfYPw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9hU0B1q8rhnvrb7hbjt_lgLwY61hHWZYtLVskrlGBHRg&oe=6A3A907B"}, {"file_name": "2023-07-01 19-38-56.mp4.00_05_33_04.Still001.png", "id": "1014728119759484", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974571_1014728126426150_3738956639406327634_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cw4weCkEIYAQ7kNvwFZgaZy&_nc_oc=Adp6KcqX03o1f7AjfE9qf4D4OsNBvDTLj4WIuytTlHqGlk9uYbqMkhw8WWtCb4E3yl4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9YLzNaRBjrRAqNdfpjrPwpteC4LvQO41wb2MmvND4bnw&oe=6A3AA5F3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_End_Card-Recovered.png", "id": "273391962004750", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974788_273391965338083_1886064065722113930_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=omdJlpGb0ZAQ7kNvwFTGUC4&_nc_oc=AdpUlFobeU8XxCKT64lmbWuJKlzC-CJtX9IqddpWBcDEXE9_mI81RWDwmg1j6Q-hWqc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-UGC_DfqBqliPC5AEVSPZY3iwlaFKLY6t1zVARzSUDcw&oe=6A3AA3F2"}, "display_name": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures", "keywords": ["Cockpit", "Alien", "Green", "Space", "Physics"], "long_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?\n\n\u2022 Become one with the ship: Immerse yourself in a cockpit packed full from ceiling to floor with distinct physics-based interactions (Though make sure to keep your eye on them all if you want to survive!).\n\n\u2022 Rebel against The Empire: Engage in thrilling dogfights as squads of enemies pursue you to re-capture the small green treasure aboard your ship - shoot bullets, launch bombs, and raise your shields. It's going to get bumpy!\n\n\u2022 Navigate the vacuum of space: Control the ship with a radical and easy-to-use virtual flight stick design, dodge your way through hazardous space environments, and don't forget to do a barrel roll!\n\n\u2022 The little guy: Who could forget your cosmic friend, Ziggy?! This mysterious creature is a perfect fuel source. You can also play with them, use them as a resource, feed them, and most importantly pet them!\n\n\u2022 The Journey: Fight your way through 13 unique levels total. Forge a different path each time by beating challenges and unlocking harder worlds en route.", "short_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Ziggy_Monoscopic.png", "id": "1296582511245835", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974446_1296582517912501_8438674573824683709_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pxcdWN0G72AQ7kNvwEZLAv9&_nc_oc=AdofIxcz2ydV4ja2wYlG2vy0dwtNycSOFO0U-JA70y2bNQ4FE3T7_jRqPZLWhZZBGWs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-pBKgqAm7F3spdhMro85uALLvaOIudDhStuiNf6pD_og&oe=6A3A9B53"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "1124369782419830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036658_1124369785753163_6062844584904789074_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VWVpz5KxhXYQ7kNvwGHaKa4&_nc_oc=Adrsh50q1qxSROgGDvn-pvvHnB7cCBfLDP2DXa6ioO0n8Z1ugXI9MQrLNHzbjEyZ4Rk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_6t1aU8Im7MQk6OZkzWLxpfNnzcsFShE7-8sU8dlHwlA&oe=6A3A976F"}, {"file_name": "Icon_v1.png", "id": "1106448921139578", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001696_1106448927806244_1890053882317213161_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RIse-byTlP8Q7kNvwFkOOrH&_nc_oc=AdqtD-Mrq8o8buCHIj0JO7Y3EgBeLopZ8uWLmMrwGqrVbmKNiksj9ONanjpHqcm5Q9c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_5mQBHWlD3xcWx6pyO97lk0S5lyNmJTlkK7NkIeGuXFw&oe=6A3AA322"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "973425620588096", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86610716_973425627254762_521808747164